        <body>
            <div xml:id="d32-a7">

                <pb facs="0735" n="725" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv08/pg725"/>

                <head>Appendix E to HD–73</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">drafting committee</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Draft of Letter From the President
                        of<lb/>the Conference to the Spanish Ambassador at Paris</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">A.S. of the Council of<lb/>the League of Nations</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Ambassador</hi>: You were kind enough to
                    communicate to the General Secretariat of the Conference, unofficially, the
                    letter which you will address, at the time of the entry into force of the Treaty
                    with Germany, to the President of the Conference, advising him of the adhesion
                    of the Spanish Government to the League of Nations.</p>
                <p>The near entry into force of the Treaty with Germany …</p>
                <p>(the rest as in the collective letter addressed to the first Delegates.)<anchor
                        n="8" xml:id="d32-f1"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
